{c: Verse 1}
[C]Bichhde abhi [F]to ham [C]bas kal parson,
[G]Jioongi main [F]kaise, is [C]haal mein barson.
[C]Maut na aayi, teri yaad kyon aayi,
[C]Hay lambi judai!
[C]Chaar dinon [F]ka pyaar [C]ho rabba...
[C]Badi [B]lambi judai, [C]lambi judai...
[C]Honthon pe [F]aaye, meri [C]jaan duhai,
[C]Hay lambi judai!
[C]Chaar dinon [F]ka pyaar [C]ho rabba...
[C]Badi [B]lambi judai, [C]lambi judai...
